\[S_{d}(t)=S_{d}(0)\exp\left(\int_{0}^{t}\left[r(u)-\tfrac{1}{2}\|\sigma_{d}(u)\| ^{2}\right]\,du+\int_{0}^{t}\sigma_{d}(u)^{\top}\,dW(u)\right), \tag{1.47}\]

