We call a process \(W(t)=(W_{1}(t),\ldots,W_{d}(t))^{\top}\), \(0\leq t\leq T\), a standard Brownian motion on \(\Re^{d}\) if it has \(W(0)=0\), continuous sample paths, independent increments, and

