#### Pricing Derivatives

We have noted two important features of LIBOR market models: they are based on observable market rates, and (in contrast to the HJM framework) they admit deterministic volatilities \(\sigma_{j}\). A third important and closely related feature arises in the pricing of interest rate caps.

