and

\[\tilde{W}_{i}(t_{k})=\sum_{j=1}^{k}\sqrt{t_{j}-t_{j-1}}\frac{Z_{ij}-\bar{Z}_{ j}}{s_{j}}.\]

This transformation preserves the independence of increments whereas (4.64) does not.

