\[\tilde{S}_{i}(t)=S(0)e^{rT}\frac{ne^{\sigma W_{i}(t)}}{\sum_{j=1}^{n}e^{\sigma W _{j}(t)}}.\]

This transformation does not lend itself as easily to matching higher moments.

