The Euler scheme for the bivariate diffusion is

\[\hat{r}(i+1) = \hat{r}(i)+\mu(\hat{r}(i))h+\sigma(\hat{r}(i))\Delta W\] \[\hat{D}(i+1) = \hat{D}(i)-\hat{r}(i)\hat{D}(i)h.\]

