#### Multiple Parameters

Suppose now that \(\theta\) is a vector of parameters \((\theta_{1},\ldots,\theta_{m})\) and that we need to estimate the sensitivity of \(\alpha(\theta)=\mathsf{E}[Y(\theta)]\) to each of these parameters. A straightforward approach selects an increment \(h_{i}\) for each \(\theta_{i}\) and estimates \(\partial\alpha/\partial\theta_{i}\) using

