\[\Delta S=CZ\quad\mbox{ with }\quad CC^{\top}=\Sigma_{S}.\]

In terms of \(Z\), the quadratic approximation to \(L=-\Delta V\) becomes

\[L\approx a-(C^{\top}\delta)^{\top}Z-{{\frac{1}{2}}}Z^{\top}(C^{\top} \Gamma C)Z \tag{9.3}\]

with \(a=-(\Delta t)\partial V/\partial t\) deterministic.

